Cell["\<\
In this section, we find the fixed points of the  2-D z-x system and 3-D \
x-y-z system, along with their stability character, and plot their phase \
spaces. We also plot the compact Z-X system. Here, we do not fix specific \
values of the parameters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.960653932774967*^9, 3.960653934782398*^9}, {
  3.9606544853780155`*^9, 3.960654593963976*^9}, {3.9606546487891197`*^9, 
  3.960654663870367*^9}, {3.9606553457588463`*^9, 
  3.960655402134987*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a65b63ed-7baf-8748-9170-\
b5c0cd283bf0"],

