Cell["\<\
When \[Epsilon] = -1, wx > - 1 + \[ScriptCapitalR]  for the (0,\
\[ScriptCapitalR]) fixed point to be an attractor. Therefore, this excludes \
wx < -1 for \[Epsilon] = -1 and 0 < \[ScriptCapitalR] < 1.\
\>", "Text",
