Cell["\<\
We find that the two intercepts of the a\[CloseCurlyQuote]\[CloseCurlyQuote] \
= 0 curve on the x-axis cannot be such that the attractor is in a \
deceleration period for wx > -1 and \[Epsilon] < 0. Therefore, all cases we \
consider have a late-time acceleration. \
\>", "Text",
