Cell["\<\
In this section, we analyse the dynamics when q > 3. In this case, only one \
separatrix between the repellor and saddle exists, and all trajectories \
expand towards the attractor fixed point representing a cosmological \
constant, except for the separatrix which expands towards the saddle. \
Therefore, all trajectories are non-singular.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9605588350740166`*^9, 3.960558909835432*^9}, {
  3.960558998852247*^9, 3.9605590374269295`*^9}, {3.9606630137513237`*^9, 
  3.96066303699488*^9}, {3.960907449540983*^9, 
  3.960907459287573*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3f983cfd-c87b-1b47-ae26-\
cddf11bd42a3"]
}, Closed]],

