Cell["\<\
Trajectories are plotted on a constant X0-Z0 surface, where X0 is fixed for \
all cases and Z0 is fixed for each phase space to give a different number of \
Einstein fixed points. k and Y0 differ for each trajectory in each phase \
space.\
\>", "Text",
